## User Roles

### Admin

The Admin is responsible for controlling access to the system.

When an Academy or Scout registers, the account remains **pending** until the Admin verifies the submitted information and approves the account.

The Admin can:

```text
Registration
     |
   Pending
     |
Admin Reviews
     |
 +---+----+
 |        |
 v        v
Approve  Reject
 |
Access System
```

The Admin also has access to academy, scout, and player management features.

---

## Academy

The Academy is the main source of player information.

After registration and Admin approval, an Academy can access its dashboard and manage its players.

Academies can:

* Add players
* Update players
* Delete players
* Upload player photos
* Add complete player information
* Add basic player information first
* Complete player evaluation later

