## Player Evaluation

When an Academy opens the **Unevaluated Players** section, players waiting for evaluation are displayed.

Each player has an **Evaluate** button.

```text
Unevaluated Players

Player        Age     Position       Status          Action
------------------------------------------------------------
Arun          19      Forward        Not Evaluated   Evaluate
Rahul         20      Midfielder     Not Evaluated   Evaluate
```

Selecting **Evaluate** opens the full player update form.

The Academy can then add:

* Preferred foot
* Height
* Weight
* Phone
* Photo
* Technical skills
* Physical skills
* Defensive skills
* Mental and tactical skills

After the evaluation is completed:

```python
player.is_evaluated = True
```

The player then becomes an evaluated player and can be managed normally.

