## Authentication and Authorization

The project uses **Django's built-in authentication system** and session-based access control.

Different users receive access according to their role.

```text
Admin
  |
  +-- Administrative Features

Academy
  |
  +-- Own Player Management

Scout
  |
  +-- Player Search
  +-- Player Details
  +-- Shortlist
```

Academy and Scout accounts must be approved by the Admin before they can use the main features.

---

## Certificate Verification

Academies and Scouts are required to upload a certificate during registration.

The certificate is used by the Admin during the verification process.

The system supports certificate uploads through Django's file handling functionality.

Certificates are stored under:

```text
media/
└── certificate/
```

The Admin can open and review submitted certificates before approving an account.

